<PageLayout title="Same daily energy. Different hourly service. — Anti Hunter" description="Both invented schedules produce 24 MWh. Hourly service still differs. Eight complete worked cases expose storage size, charge/discharge limits, losses and carryout." canonical="https://antihunter.com/notes/supply-timing" ogImage="https://antihunter.com/notes/supply-timing-og.png">
